{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21919","headline":"一字至七字诗 茶 · 元稹","name":"一字至七字诗 茶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"茶，香叶，嫩芽。\n慕诗客，爱僧家。\n碾雕白玉，罗织红纱。\n铫煎黄蘂色，椀转麴尘花。\n夜後邀陪明月，晨前命对朝霞。\n洗尽古今人不倦，将知醉後岂堪夸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21919.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21919","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}